# Law24 UI Protection Rule

Do not replace or simplify restored UI layout/components in `Mobile/app` and `Mobile/components`.

Allowed changes:
- Connect existing UI to APIs
- Add loading/empty/error handling
- Minor bug fixes that preserve visual layout

Not allowed without explicit user confirmation:
- Replacing screens with placeholders
- Removing sections/cards/chips from existing UI
- Deleting UI files
- Rewriting screen structure or navigation shell

When a task requests stability fixes, preserve UI and apply minimal targeted patches.
